<h2>The Three Layers We Build</h2>
<h3>Task lighting</h3>
<p>Outdoor kitchens, grill stations and bar counters need real light on the work surface, roughly 30 to 50 footcandles at the counter. We get there with small shielded downlights under a pergola beam or eave, or with linear LED strips tucked under a counter overhang or inside a cabinet toe kick. Task zones are the brightest in the design and the first to be dimmed when cooking is done.</p>
<h3>Ambient lighting</h3>
